The file nouns.jsonl.gz in this directory is derived data, not source code.
It is licensed separately from the rest of nass.

Source
    English Wiktionary, https://en.wiktionary.org
    Extracted with Wiktextract, https://kaikki.org/dictionary/Arabic/
    Upstream file: kaikki.org-dictionary-Arabic.jsonl, built 2026-10-30
    sha256 19eee17681c23b3da039878ee7c970d93b75a339989a17a842f14aa7f44ea236

