Modifications
    Only the plural and dual cells of the declension tables for nouns,
    adjectives and proper names were kept. Entries whose every sense is an
    inflected form (tagged form-of) were dropped. Each row was reduced to the
    lemma, its plural and dual forms, a sense count and a short gloss.
    The result is 10,860 rows covering 9,223 lemmas.

Rebuild with tools/build_data.py. The script is MIT like the rest of nass;
this data file is not.
